  "description": "VOKPUI crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P -3 c 1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H120 Er3 N6 Ni3 O22 1+,Cl1 O4 1-,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.374-3.777 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.63-108.03°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ni3Er3(μ3-O)(μ3-OH)3(L)3(μ-OOCCMe3)3](ClO4)·3CH2Cl2·2CH3OH·3H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
